WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:26.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.000 --> 01:30.000
"Tamed"

3
01:32.500 --> 01:35.700
(EP3: The Night Someone Fell First)

4
01:37.200 --> 01:38.239
Brother.

5
01:38.359 --> 01:39.540
Where are you?

6
01:52.299 --> 01:53.040
Brother.

7
01:53.040 --> 01:54.040
What are you doing?

8
02:00.260 --> 02:01.540
Hiding someone here?

9
02:02.180 --> 02:03.560
In the middle of the night?

10
02:04.000 --> 02:05.000
Who's showering?

11
02:05.319 --> 02:06.319
No one.

12
02:07.959 --> 02:09.039
OK.

13
02:09.180 --> 02:10.180
I won't ask then.

14
02:11.240 --> 02:12.360
Why are you here?

15
02:12.639 --> 02:13.840
It's my brother's place.

16
02:13.960 --> 02:15.520
I can come whenever I want.

17
02:18.939 --> 02:20.539
At this hour,

18
02:20.560 --> 02:21.800
you're doing laundry?

19
02:22.000 --> 02:23.000
There's a leak.

20
02:25.620 --> 02:26.620
Brother.

21
02:28.080 --> 02:29.400
I need to tell you something.

22
02:31.479 --> 02:32.479
That night...

23
02:32.860 --> 02:34.240
what did it mean to you?

24
02:36.560 --> 02:38.240
Something that should never have happened.

25
02:38.340 --> 02:39.900
But it did happen.

26
02:40.419 --> 02:42.060
And it's etched in my heart.

27
02:46.180 --> 02:47.180
Afraid of me?

28
02:48.360 --> 02:49.800
Or afraid you...

29
02:51.439 --> 02:52.879
want it again, too?

30
03:01.840 --> 03:02.840
Shen Mo.

31
03:03.539 --> 03:04.539
What?

32
03:05.479 --> 03:07.039
Before the guesthouse,

33
03:07.919 --> 03:09.159
we'd already

34
03:10.280 --> 03:11.439
had a...

35
03:13.500 --> 03:14.500
chance encounter.

36
03:21.759 --> 03:24.680
I've decided. I'll pursue him.

37
03:25.180 --> 03:27.400
He's the one you like?

38
03:32.780 --> 03:34.000
That guy

39
03:34.520 --> 03:35.919
is more intoxicating than alcohol.

40
03:36.340 --> 03:40.199
One taste and you're hooked.

41
03:47.520 --> 03:50.620
The moment we met, I knew.

42
03:51.039 --> 03:52.080
I couldn't quit him.

43
03:52.659 --> 03:53.659
Cheng Yuze.

44
03:55.620 --> 03:56.719
Are you serious?

45
04:03.020 --> 04:04.300
Even if it's playing with fire,

46
04:05.159 --> 04:06.240
and I get burned,

47
04:07.379 --> 04:08.579
I'm willing to take that risk.

48
04:16.180 --> 04:17.180
OK.

49
04:18.680 --> 04:20.959
If you're in love, go all in.

50
04:23.639 --> 04:24.839
If it all falls apart,

51
04:26.120 --> 04:27.240
I'll have your back.

52
04:38.879 --> 04:39.879
By the way,

53
04:40.740 --> 04:41.879
Jin Yumo will be back home.

54
04:42.240 --> 04:43.400
If you don't make a move now,

55
04:43.560 --> 04:44.879
you'll lose your chance.

56
04:45.040 --> 04:46.320
She's got so much going for her.

57
04:47.000 --> 04:49.680
Her suitors could line up all the way to France.

58
04:49.839 --> 04:50.879
Mind your own business.

59
04:54.040 --> 04:55.160
I'll watch a movie tonight.

60
04:55.239 --> 04:56.239
I'll stay over.

61
04:56.323 --> 04:57.916
[They're watching "Casablanca"]

62
05:07.279 --> 05:08.279
What's that noise?

63
05:09.839 --> 05:10.839
You should head back.

64
05:12.019 --> 05:13.019
Brother.

65
05:13.100 --> 05:14.100
No, wait...

66
05:18.279 --> 05:19.519
Is this really my brother?

67
06:43.920 --> 06:44.920
Damn. Me too...

68
06:49.079 --> 06:50.898
Pet Code, Rule Seven:

69
06:50.899 --> 06:52.699
No staying up past 11 p.m.

70
07:48.060 --> 07:49.060
I'm...

71
07:49.819 --> 07:50.819
I'm sorry.

72
07:52.199 --> 07:53.199
It's OK.

73
08:38.476 --> 08:39.643
[Countdown: 19 days]

74
08:42.516 --> 08:44.109
[18 days]

75
08:49.010 --> 08:50.210
[17 days]

76
09:01.080 --> 09:02.080
Did you bring these?

77
09:02.500 --> 09:03.320
Is that OK?

78
09:03.500 --> 09:05.379
Left over from my shift at the flower shop.

79
09:05.600 --> 09:07.080
It seemed a shame to throw them away.

80
09:07.340 --> 09:08.359
And I think

81
09:08.360 --> 09:10.240
they'll bring a little life to the place.

82
09:11.460 --> 09:13.103
Go change your clothes and wash them.

83
09:13.340 --> 09:14.659
Throw those flowers away.

84
09:15.080 --> 09:16.440
I don't like the smell of flowers.

85
09:29.039 --> 09:30.433
[It's expired. You can't drink it.]

86
09:36.299 --> 09:37.878
That milk really is expired.

87
09:37.879 --> 09:38.879
Got it.

88
09:42.840 --> 09:44.480
15 days left.

89
09:47.399 --> 09:48.559
It will rain today.

90
10:07.960 --> 10:08.960
It's broken.

91
10:10.159 --> 10:11.159
It's not.

92
10:15.320 --> 10:16.320
It's broken.

93
10:36.610 --> 10:38.050
[Cheng Law Practice]

94
10:40.279 --> 10:41.259
Cheng Yu'an.

95
10:41.260 --> 10:42.499
Nice little trick.

96
10:42.500 --> 10:44.519
Where did you dig up that evidence?

97
10:44.639 --> 10:46.359
Half my life's hard work,

98
10:46.360 --> 10:47.200
and you ruined it all!

99
10:47.200 --> 10:48.200
What's the meaning of this?

100
10:50.679 --> 10:52.199
Courts care about evidence,

101
10:52.200 --> 10:53.200
not how hard you worked.

102
10:53.480 --> 10:55.160
You falsified your copyright registration.

103
10:55.559 --> 10:56.979
That's your own problem.

104
10:56.980 --> 10:58.380
Spare me the fucking legal lecture!

105
10:58.600 --> 10:59.600
Cheng Yu'an.

106
10:59.759 --> 11:00.960
Playing that dirty,

107
11:01.080 --> 11:02.320
aren't you afraid of karma?

108
11:02.679 --> 11:03.679
Fuck.

109
11:03.960 --> 11:05.519
Watch your mouth.

110
11:05.980 --> 11:07.620
Throwing a fit because you lost the case?

111
11:08.179 --> 11:09.179
Get the hell out.

112
11:12.039 --> 11:13.039
Cheng Yu'an.

113
11:13.440 --> 11:15.159
Actually, I came here today

114
11:15.519 --> 11:17.240
for more than that damn contract.

115
11:18.320 --> 11:19.638
I heard

116
11:19.639 --> 11:21.000
you're investigating Lin Yuanshan.

117
11:21.159 --> 11:23.559
Lin Yuanshan's sketches, unpublished when he died,

118
11:24.100 --> 11:25.179
or

119
11:25.359 --> 11:27.878
the whereabouts of his missing son.

120
11:28.559 --> 11:29.960
Give me either one,

121
11:30.399 --> 11:31.639
and we'll call it even.

122
11:39.059 --> 11:40.240
Not a chance.

123
11:43.433 --> 11:45.313
If you want to fucking play dirty,

124
11:45.659 --> 11:47.220
give it all you've got.

125
11:51.440 --> 11:52.440
Just you wait.

126
11:54.340 --> 11:55.340
Fuck.

127
12:05.659 --> 12:06.399
Behave.

128
12:06.539 --> 12:08.419
Once you're connected, don't disconnect.

129
12:37.279 --> 12:38.279
Asleep?

130
12:39.519 --> 12:40.519
So well-behaved.

131
13:36.500 --> 13:38.139
Your breathing sounds off.

132
13:38.759 --> 13:39.759
You're breathing so fast.

133
13:53.080 --> 13:54.080
You're burning up.

134
14:37.960 --> 14:39.480
A fever, all of a sudden?

135
14:39.720 --> 14:41.679
Did you get caught in the rain?

136
14:42.620 --> 14:44.620
The umbrellas are by the door.

137
14:45.279 --> 14:46.860
You must have gone out without one.

138
14:48.220 --> 14:50.700
Don't you know how to look after yourself?

139
15:29.139 --> 15:31.899
You stayed here all night?

140
15:32.899 --> 15:33.860
You're awake.

141
15:33.861 --> 15:36.100
Anything else bothering you?

142
15:37.240 --> 15:38.299
Who let you in?

143
15:42.879 --> 15:44.320
I just...

144
15:44.480 --> 15:46.500
heard you weren't feeling well yesterday.

145
15:46.639 --> 15:48.019
I knocked, but you didn't answer.

146
15:48.279 --> 15:50.000
The Pet Code says:

147
15:51.179 --> 15:52.779
Without permission,

148
15:52.899 --> 15:55.419
you must not enter your master's private space.

149
15:55.740 --> 15:57.379
The bedroom is strictly off-limits.

150
15:58.320 --> 15:59.918
Without permission,

151
15:59.919 --> 16:02.138
you must not enter your master's bedroom.

152
16:02.139 --> 16:03.378
Never get on the bed.

153
16:03.379 --> 16:04.700
Never stay overnight.

154
16:06.940 --> 16:08.100
Good. You know the rules.

155
16:10.580 --> 16:11.620
Don't let it happen again.

156
16:23.039 --> 16:24.039
Dr. Shen.

157
16:24.259 --> 16:27.515
Taking over Cheng Yuze's psychological counseling won't be a problem, will it?

158
16:27.539 --> 16:28.620
No problem, Chairman Cheng.

159
16:29.799 --> 16:31.799
He's been rebellious since childhood.

160
16:32.100 --> 16:34.980
I want more than just appearances.

161
16:38.740 --> 16:39.740
Keep an eye on him.

162
16:40.019 --> 16:41.299
Don't let him out of your sight.

163
16:41.500 --> 16:43.059
Especially those around him.

164
16:43.740 --> 16:45.219
If anything seems off,

165
16:45.220 --> 16:46.740
I want to know right away.

166
16:48.220 --> 16:49.220
Understood.

167
16:51.299 --> 16:52.860
If, in the future,

168
16:53.220 --> 16:55.019
he's still the same as before,

169
16:55.299 --> 16:56.279
ungrateful

170
16:56.280 --> 16:57.379
and self-destructive,

171
16:58.340 --> 16:59.638
send him away.

172
16:59.639 --> 17:00.919
As far away as possible.

173
17:01.299 --> 17:02.500
Out of sight, out of mind.

174
17:05.119 --> 17:06.838
A boarding school abroad,

175
17:06.839 --> 17:08.079
or a correctional institution.

176
17:08.960 --> 17:10.220
As long as

177
17:10.420 --> 17:12.019
he stays out of my sight.

178
17:12.180 --> 17:13.420
Whatever my dad says,

179
17:13.700 --> 17:14.720
just agree to it.

180
17:15.019 --> 17:16.019
Just do me this favor.

181
17:18.500 --> 17:19.580
No problem, Chairman Cheng.

182
17:19.819 --> 17:20.960
I'll arrange it if needed.

183
17:21.599 --> 17:22.599
OK.

184
17:32.619 --> 17:34.920
[Cheng Yuze] Shen Mo. Did you miss me?

185
17:48.223 --> 17:49.603
[Shanghai pop music broadcast]

186
18:44.339 --> 18:45.400
It lit up again.

187
19:04.200 --> 19:05.440
As for Lin Yuanshan,

188
19:06.000 --> 19:08.259
get all his unpublished sketches

189
19:09.240 --> 19:10.720
back to me within a week.

190
19:59.680 --> 20:00.719
The last song:

191
20:00.720 --> 20:01.720
"Caged Beast."

192
20:27.019 --> 20:28.019
You're back.

193
21:16.640 --> 21:18.759
The Pet Code says I mustn't touch it.

194
21:19.000 --> 21:20.559
But if I fix it,

195
21:20.579 --> 21:22.359
he'll reward me, right?

196
21:57.819 --> 21:59.079
What is he doing?

197
21:59.400 --> 22:00.799
Why is it so quiet?

198
22:06.940 --> 22:08.200
Breathing...

199
22:08.819 --> 22:10.460
His breathing... so close.

200
23:06.180 --> 23:07.900
(Next Episode) Did Dad tell you to watch me,

201
23:08.285 --> 23:09.726
or did you want to come yourself?

202
23:09.900 --> 23:10.900
Done asking?

203
23:11.660 --> 23:12.660
Not yet.

204
23:24.740 --> 23:26.220
What does the Pet Code say?

205
23:27.000 --> 23:29.240
Can we make an exception tonight?

206
23:33.680 --> 23:34.680
Don't go.

207
23:37.680 --> 23:38.680
Don't go.
